USMC CPL Seth Rasmuson Memorial Highway. 25LSO-0683, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $3,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the Department
of Transportation.
DETAIL OF APPROPRIATION
Agency #: 045 Agency Name: Department of Transportation
