GENERAL FUND $3,000
Description of appropriation:
The Department of Transportation indicates the funds appropriated from this bill
will be expended to place a sign along each side of U.S. Highway 16 between mile
marker 52.47 and 89 in Johnson County. The appropriation will cover the cost for
two signs that have 6" letters and will be 3.5' x 6.5' on wood posts. Any unexpended,
unobligated funds from this appropriation shall revert on June 30, 2026.
